msgid "Budgie uses SQLCipher-backed SQLite with AES-256 encryption. The encryption key is derived from your device keychain and is never transmitted off the device."
msgstr "Budgie usa SQLite respaldado por SQLCipher con cifrado AES-256. La clave de cifrado se deriva del llavero de tu dispositivo y nunca se transmite fuera del dispositivo."

