#: src/generic/component/ai-section-features/ai-section-features.tsx:19
msgid "Unlike ChatGPT or Google Assistant, Budgie's AI runs entirely on your device. The multilingual nomic-embed-text-v2-moe embedding model handles all 5 supported languages natively."
