msgid "Voice is the fastest input mode for an expense — but every voice budgeting app today streams microphone data to a vendor server. Budgie keeps the audio stream entirely on the device, then runs whisper.rn (a whisper.cpp-backed React Native library) for transcription and a local LLM for entity extraction."
