#: src/app/[lang]/features/data-export/page.tsx:95
msgid "Your data, your call. Budgie ships two exports: a flat CSV for spreadsheets and a full SQLCipher database file for full restore. Both are user-initiated and saved through the OS share sheet."
msgstr "Tus datos, tu decisión. Budgie incluye dos exportaciones: un CSV plano para hojas de cálculo y un archivo de base de datos SQLCipher completo para una restauración total."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/ynab-alternatives-privacy/page.tsx:1430
msgid "Your Device is the Database"
